<script setup lang="ts">
import {formatPen,penCents} from '@/lib/financeMoney';
defineProps<{summary:{series?:{month:string;billed:string;received:string}[];zones?:{name:string;amount:string}[];services?:{service_type:string;amount:string}[]}}>();
const width=(v:string,values:string[])=>`${Math.max(0,Math.min(100,penCents(v)/Math.max(1,...values.map(x=>Math.abs(penCents(x))))*100))}%`;
</script>
<template><div class="finance-charts"><article class="finance-panel"><h2>Facturación y caja neta mensual</h2><p>Emisión y recepción/reverso son fechas diferentes.</p><div v-for="m in summary.series" :key="m.month" class="chart-period"><small>{{m.month.slice(0,7)}}</small><div><span>Emitido {{formatPen(m.billed)}}</span><i class="chart-billed" :style="{width:width(m.billed,(summary.series??[]).flatMap(x=>[x.billed,x.received]))}"></i><span>Caja neta {{formatPen(m.received)}}</span><i class="chart-cash" :style="{width:width(m.received,(summary.series??[]).flatMap(x=>[x.billed,x.received]))}"></i></div></div><p v-if="!summary.series?.length">Sin movimientos del período.</p></article><article class="finance-panel"><h2>Recaudación neta por PON</h2><div v-for="z in summary.zones" :key="z.name" class="chart-line"><span>{{z.name}}</span><b>{{formatPen(z.amount)}}</b><i class="chart-cash" :style="{width:width(z.amount,(summary.zones??[]).map(x=>x.amount))}"></i></div><p v-if="!summary.zones?.length">Sin cobros del nuevo libro.</p><h2 class="chart-title">Emisión por servicio</h2><div v-for="s in summary.services" :key="s.service_type" class="chart-line"><span>{{s.service_type==='solo_iptv'?'IPTV':'Paquete Internet'}}</span><b>{{formatPen(s.amount)}}</b><i class="chart-billed" :style="{width:width(s.amount,(summary.services??[]).map(x=>x.amount))}"></i></div><p>Los paquetes se contabilizan una vez, sin dividir cargos artificialmente.</p></article></div></template>
<style scoped>.finance-charts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:18px}.chart-period{display:flex;gap:16px;margin:12px 0;font-size:10px}.chart-period>div{flex:1}.chart-period span{display:block}.chart-period i,.chart-line i{display:block;height:5px;border-radius:2px;margin:5px 0 8px;min-width:0}.chart-billed{background:#89a8bf}.chart-cash{background:#6e9e8b}.chart-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;font-size:11px;gap:6px;margin:12px 0}.chart-line i{grid-column:1/-1}.chart-title{margin-top:24px}@media(max-width:850px){.finance-charts{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
